  "id": "spicy-black-bean-vegetable-soup",
  "name": "Spicy Black Bean Vegetable Soup",
  "subtitle": "A hearty bean soup with vegetables, corn, and warm spices.",
  "description": "Black beans, carrots, corn, tomatoes, and savory spices simmer together for a warming vegetable soup.",
